hursday, June 19. </span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:175%; text-align:center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:175%; text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Green Street News Canada delivers a 360-degree view of the Canadian CRE market, helping you unlock valuable context that can shape investment strategies and highlight off-market opportunities.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:175%; text-align:center\" align=\"center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height:175%; font-weight:bold; text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Stay ahead of the curve with:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"line-height:175%\">\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Verified reporting on deals, leasing activity, and leadership changes</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Comprehensive coverage across Canada’s major markets and asset-classes</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Industry context you won’t find anywhere else, delivered several hours ahead of free sources, by seasoned journalists with deep industry ties</span></li>\n</ul>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span></div>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"\" style=\"\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"hs_padded\" style=\"font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#23496d; word-break:break-word; padding:15px 25px 25px\"><div id=\"hs_cos_wrapper_module_15949568556487\" class=\"hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit;\" data-hs-cos-general-type=\"widget\" data-hs-cos-type=\"module\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse:separate!important\">